OL,3,GNEWSAThe winners of Radio Humberside
OL,4,AMake a Difference
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn octogenarian who has taught
OL,7,Fgenerations of children how to garden
OL,8,Fand a young boy who helped support an
OL,9,Fautistic child in his foster family are
OL,10,Fsome of the winners of this year's BBC
OL,11,FRadio Humberside Make A Difference
OL,12,FAwards.
OL,14,FEight individuals were handed awards
OL,15,Fwhich were designed to recognise those
OL,16,Fwho have made outstanding contributions
OL,17,Fto their communities.
OL,19,FThe awards ceremony was held at Hull
OL,20,FCity Hall on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
