OL,3,GNEWSAThe winners of Radio Humberside
OL,4,AMake a Difference
OL,5,
OL,6,FCollecting the Volunteer Award, Walter
OL,7,FMinns, 88, who runs a children's
OL,8,Fgardening club at a nursery in Sancton,
OL,9,FEast Yorkshire, said: "I love being
OL,10,Fwith the children, it makes me get up
OL,11,Fin the morning."
